  "releaseNotes": "v5.1.0: Dependency refresh across the stack (Npgsql 10, Microsoft.Data.Sqlite 10, Microsoft.Data.SqlClient 7, MySqlConnector 2.6, Watson 7.1, RestWrapper 3.2, SyslogLogging 2.2). Fixes forwarding of the client Authorization header to origin servers: RestWrapper 3.2 applies Authorization via a typed property and ignores it in the raw header collection, so the gateway now forwards it through Authorization.Raw, preserving any scheme (Bearer, Basic, or custom).",
